1N     Pass   3N     Pass
Pass   Pass
{[show S]

The opponents have bid to 3NT and it is your lead. You hold \SKQT9 — choose your card.

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SQ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Lead the \SQ from \SKQT9 — the lower of your top honours. The queen asks partner to unblock the jack: with \SJx it drops under your queen, and your \SK-T-9 then run once the ace is knocked out. Partner obliges, and the suit is solid.}

