1N     Pass   3N     Pass
Pass   Pass
{[show SE]
[showcards N:SQ, E:S4]

Partner led the \SQ against notrump and dummy plays low. You are third hand, holding the \SJ — which card do you play?

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SJ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Unblock — play the \SJ under the queen. Partner’s queen promises the \SK and \ST sitting behind it, a suit that needs only your jack to run. Drop it now; hold it and you are stuck winning the third round with a bare jack, jamming partner’s long suit just as it should be cashing.}

