{[show S]

The opponents have bid to 3NT and it is your lead. You hold \SQJ98 — choose your card.

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SJ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Lead the \SJ from \SQJ98 — the lower of your top honours. The jack asks partner to unblock the ten: with \STx it falls under your jack, and once you drive out the ace and king your \SQ-9-8 cash. The honour just below your top card is the unblock request.}

