{[show SE]
[showcards N:SJ, E:S4]

Partner led the \SJ against notrump and dummy plays low. You are third hand, holding the \ST — which card do you play?

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card ST] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Unblock — play the \ST under the jack. Partner’s jack shows the \SQ and \S9 around it, a suit missing only your ten. Let it go so partner’s \SQ-9-8 run once the ace and king are forced out; keep it and your ten blocks the suit on the third round.}

